edukasaun-desktop-menu (0.10.0~beta3) trixie; urgency=medium

  * Licenses: GPL-3.0-or-later with SPDX lines, a LICENSE file and a
    machine-readable copyright file listing every third-party part (Orchis,
    Graphite, Yaru-remix, Noto Emoji, Natural Earth); more credits in About.
  * Packaging: Debian changelog, manual pages for all commands, conffiles for
    the files in /etc, dh-style systemd handling; the package scripts no
    longer kill running programs, start programs as root or write into home
    folders. lintian: no errors or warnings.
  * Dependencies for Debian 13 (libqt5svg5, lxqt-session, dbus-bin, X11
    tools); the unused python3-xdg is dropped.
  * Autostart entries are LXQt modules (X-LXQt-Module, TryExec,
    --autostart); outside Eduka-Desktop sessions LXQt keeps its own panel
    and notifications. Eduka-Panel and Eduka-Desktop restart themselves
    after a package update.
  * Automatic login has its own polkit action that always asks for an
    administrator password; the login screen helper copies pictures safely.
  * Openbox: the theme goes to the file Openbox really reads; xfwm4: no
    square shadow around Eduka-Panel.
  * Liquid Glass: Action Center and popups in the theme blue, readable glass
    over dark wallpapers; readable "Action Center" label; deeper text
    shadow on the light login screen styles.
  * Light themes use Papirus-Light: dark Wi-Fi, sound and battery icons on
    the light panel (plain Papirus drew them light grey).
  * Bug fixes: Close on the task bar no longer kills windows, the menu no
    longer opens by itself, XDG-correct application list started without a
    shell, task bar names, several wired ports, LUKS/LVM system disks,
    weather switch, battery detection, eduka-panel-reset keeps a backup.
  * Translations (Portuguese, Indonesian, Tetun) of the new texts.
  * Details: /usr/share/edukasaun-desktop/doc/HISTORY.txt

 -- Edukasaun OS <dev@edukasaun.org>  Tue, 27 Oct 2026 02:35:16 +0000

